---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const analyticsEnabled = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN);
// Launch review: owner must confirm retention practices and required operator details.
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — La Gente de La Tierra" description="How this website handles inquiries, update requests, and third-party services.">
  <header class="page-hero page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Your information<br />and this website.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Information about contacting the filmmakers and the services used by this website.</p>
  </header>
  <article class="legal-copy page-shell">
    <section><h2>Information you send</h2><p>When you contact the filmmakers, the form sends the information you provide, such as your name, email address, organization, and message. Please do not include sensitive information that is not needed for your inquiry.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Inquiries and update requests</h2><p>Contact submissions are sent to the filmmakers to respond to your inquiry. The release-update form sends an email request to the team; it does not create a website account or automatically confirm a mailing-list subscription.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Service providers</h2><p>This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Forms are processed by <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy">Web3Forms</a> and delivered to the filmmakers’ Gmail inbox. Open Sans is loaded through Google Fonts. These services receive information necessary to process the requests made to them, subject to their own privacy practices.</p>{analyticsEnabled && <p>This website also uses Plausible for website analytics. See <a href="https://plausible.io/privacy">Plausible’s privacy information</a>.</p>}<p>Links to video platforms, organizations, and other external websites take you to services with their own privacy practices.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Your information and requests</h2><p>Submitting a form creates an email record and may create records with the form provider. Closing the page does not delete those records. To ask about information you have sent, request a correction or deletion, or withdraw an email-update request, contact <a href="mailto:aestheticvoyagerfilms@gmail.com">aestheticvoyagerfilms@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
